 r←Test_Busy_004(stopFlag batchFlag);n;i;⎕TRAP;parms;globalParms;msg;noOfThreads
⍝ Exercise `Busy` with long caption.
 r←∆Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 noOfThreads←⍴⎕TNUMS

 parms←#._APLGUI.GUI.Busy.CreateParms
 parms.addToCaption←'This is a "Busy" test with a long caption!'

 msg←'This may take a moment' 'Please stay patient'
 n←parms #._APLGUI.GUI.Busy.Create msg

 :For i :In 2+⍳9
     ⎕DL 0.15
     n #._APLGUI.GUI.Busy.SetPercent 10×i
 :EndFor

 n.∆CloseForm
 →FailsIf noOfThreads≠⍴⎕TNUMS

 r←∆OK
